[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

Eagle Owl are birds found in [[Terrain|Mountain]]. They can fly over cliffs, and normally fly around on 2d speed. If you kill them, you can pick them up like [[rabbit]]s. [[Dead Eagle Owl]] takes 2x2 slots in the inventory.

Not to be confused with [[Golden Eagle]], which is rarer, tougher, and gives more items.

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Rarely Aggressive, always flying around.

